SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This licence covers the original work in this repository: the Python source,
the build scripts, the tests, the written analysis (READMEs, FINDINGS.md, the
investment brief and the structuring memo), and the derived statistics computed
by this project — the aggregate tables in
project1-green-bond-analysis/data/aggregates/ and the greenium estimator output
in project1-green-bond-analysis/data/.

It does NOT cover the third-party datasets those statistics were computed from,
which remain subject to their own terms and are deliberately not redistributed
here. The Climate Bonds Initiative extract and the Deutsche Finanzagentur yield
series are both all-rights-reserved and have been removed from this repository;
each is regenerable from its publisher by anyone who may access it.

One file is retained whose provenance is unresolved rather than permitted:
project3-climate-dashboard/data/eua_prices.csv, which names no source and over
which no rightsholder asserts terms. It is labelled indicative, not a reference
series.

See DATA.md for the provenance, terms and verification status of every dataset,
and for what was removed and why.
